A||N||14||87ECO5||Adios, Honda Prelude||||9||
Z||000000||87ECO5||08-03-2001||08:28 AM||||Add the Prelude to the growing list of sporty coupes being discontinued due to poor sales.<P>Honda announced recently that it will stop importing the Prelude because sales have declined rapidly over the past few years.<P>What will Honda use to replace it?  Current plans are to direct some potential customers to the new Acura RSX.  Others may find some interest in a "hopped up" Accord Coupe that Honda will begin producing soon.<P>I personally am saddened by this announcement.  I've always liked the Prelude, though I'll admit it seemed to butt heads with Honda's other "pocket-racers", the Integra GSR and the S2000.<P>BTW, I caught this announcement in a blurb in the most recent Motor Trend.<p>[This message has been edited by 87ECO5 (edited 08-03-2001).]||||reg||9
Z||000001||Tonker||08-03-2001||08:38 AM||||I've never really cared for the Prelude. It's a nice car, but doesn't do anything for me.<P>How does it compare price-wise to the other cars you mentioned?||||reg||5
Z||000002||87ECO5||08-03-2001||08:48 AM||||I'm not completely certain about these numbers but I believe the Prelude based around $26K, the S2000 is about $33K and the Integra GSR (now the RSX Type S) is about $24K.||||reg||1
Z||000003||bHooper||08-03-2001||09:57 AM||||i almost bought a prelude, 3 years ago, they ride nice!  and handle very well.<P>personally, i like them better than the hatchback cars.<P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B>Red</B></FONT></FONT> 86 GT 5 speed<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><B>Black</B></FONT> <u>86 SE Automatic</u>||||reg||1
Z||000004||Black88GT||08-05-2001||04:27 PM||||Ask any import guy and he will tell you, Preludes are TOO HEAVY.  You just can't do much with them.  Most people bought Integras, GSR's or Type R's, for around the same price as a Prelude.  Even the v-tec Preludes were slow.  There was no point in making it anymore, especially with the S2000 and the RSX, and the planned Civic Type R (US version) or Si, can't remember which one is supposed to come to the U.S. ||||reg||1
