Z||000007||Raydar||08-06-2001||07:50 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 87ECO5:<BR><B> Others may find some interest in a "hopped up" Accord Coupe that Honda will begin producing soon.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Acura (Honda) has confirmed a TL-S with 260 HP and a six speed manual for 2003. This is about the same time frame that calls for a redesign of the Accord. I'm guessing the 200 HP (or better) V-6 with the six-speed, too. <BR>Might have to buy one.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||1
